			"notes": "## CloudChatMC v1.0.0 — Initial Release\n\nFirst public release of CloudChatMC!\n\n### Features\n- Global encrypted chat across all worlds and servers via `/ccmc msg`\n- Private messaging between players via `/ccmc pm`\n- Online player list via `/ccmc online`\n- Connection status display via `/ccmc status`\n- In-game config updater via `/ccmc config`\n- Help command via `/ccmc help`\n- Token-based player identity system — no login required\n- Base64 message encoding with shared key\n- Auto-reconnect on disconnect with status messages in chat\n- Message queue — messages received before the player loads are saved and displayed once in-game\n- Color-coded chat — green for global, purple for private messages, cyan for system messages\n\n### Technical\n- Client-side only — no server plugin needed\n- Powered by Cloudflare Workers with Durable Objects for reliable multi-client messaging\n- Config stored in `.minecraft/config/cloudchatmc.json`\n- Compatible with Minecraft 1.21.4–1.21.11 on Fabric Loader 0.16.10+"
		}
